      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The only change would make to this, would be to have this be togglable like the profile badge for verified 18+ players, since even if a player has age verified, they might not want to advertise it right over their head everywhere they go, due to the cultural implications that exist for a lot of people on the internet when seeing the numbers 18+, even if settings that aren't related to that (true, a lot of 18+ shit is just bc ppl don't want squeakers around, but a lot of people don't take it that way, as annoying as that can be), as well as it being locked behind VRC+ for a long time, which a decent number of people have been salty about (hopefully VRC will allow everyone to age verify soon. regardless of if they have VRC+ soon).\n\nWith the profile badge other players have to go to their quick menu, click on you, then open their big menu to see that player's full profile. So, it's not as in your face, right now.\n\nFor players who are comfortable displaying that openly though, having the option to have a nameplate badge would be really helpful though, I believe, for if you're trying to avoid squeakers, and maybe one of the most helpful applications of it, making it easier for groups to moderate verified 18+ only instances (in the event someone hosting an 18+ only event accidentally forgets to push the verified 18+ only button when creating the group instance, or smth like that), as well as just helping calm nerves across the board when interacting with new people, without checking their profiles, since a lot of people, have been understandably scarred by the horror stories of the internet.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
